citation: |
  Aperio ImageScope region-crop export of a 590 tissue-microarray slide, fully
  owned by Toby C. Cornish / WSILabs and contributed expressly for the
  wsi-fixtures corpus under CC BY 4.0 (attribution required). LZW-compressed
  tiled TIFF (a non-JPEG codec only available under ImageScope's TIFF export);
  carries a mixed-codec associated-image set (LZW thumbnail + LZW label + JPEG
  overview). The regression fixture for opentile-go #28 (tiled LZW DecodedTile)
  and #29 (non-JPEG associated-image decode).
